008200     05  MPLTINFO-DDESC-LANG       PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
008300     05  MPLTINFO-DDESC2-LANG      PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
008400
008500 01  DUMMY-CODE                PIC X(8)     VALUE SPACES.
009300
009400*----------  USED IN DSET-ARRAY
009500 01  X                         PIC S9(2)    VALUE ZERO  COMP-4.
009600**************************************************************
