011500*---------- VSETERROR AND VPUTWINDOW
011600 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
011700 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
011800     05  MSG-BUFFER            PIC X(68).
011900     05  MSG-VALUE             PIC X(8).
012000 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76 COMP-4.
012100 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0  COMP-4.
012200 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1  COMP-4.
012300
012400*---------- VPRINTFORM
