012700     05  PAGE-CTL              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 49    COMP-4.
012800     05  SPOOL-FIL-OPEN-SW     PIC X        VALUE "Y".
012900
013000 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
013100 COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.
