014200**************************************************************
014300 01  DATA-BASE-VALUES.
014400    03  BASE                    PIC X(10)  VALUE "  STORES;".
014600
015300 01  MPLTINFO-ARG              PIC X(4)     VALUE "P 01".
015400 01  PLT-ARG                   PIC X(4)     VALUE SPACES.
015500
015600 COPY DBSTAT   OF COPYLIB.
015700 COPY DBSTHIST OF COPYLIB.
       COPY MEMPL    IN COPYLIB.
015800 COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTRQGB IN COPYLIB.
015900*01 VIEW-COMAREA. COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.
016000
016810 01  FORMFILE                      PIC X(26) VALUE SPACES.
019200 01  FORM-NAMES.
