045017        CALL "SQTEINFO" USING BASE,
045018                              VIEW-COMAREA,
045021                              LANGUAGE-PARMS
045024        MOVE "ZUDCQUOTE"             TO VIEW-CFNAME
045025        GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
041500
