041800                              PASS-SPOOL
041900                              VIEW-COMAREA
042000                              FORMFILE
042100                              LANGUAGE-PARMS
042200        GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
045100*----------  QUOTE REPORT MENU
045200     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR  "
