049700                              LANGUAGE-PARMS
049900        MOVE "ZUDCQUOT"              TO VIEW-CFNAME
050000        GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
050100
050200     IF SCREEN-KEY = "Q5  "
