050900        CALL "SPOBYVEN" USING BASE,
051000                              VIEW-COMAREA,
051100                              LANGUAGE-PARMS,
051200                              FORMFILE
051400        MOVE "ZUDCQUOT"              TO VIEW-CFNAME
051500        GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
051700
