              MOVE "ZUDCQUOT" TO VIEW-CFNAME
058200        GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
058300     GO TO 200-QUOT-MENU-SCREEN.
058400
058500 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
058600********************************************************
058700*       Q U O T E   R E P O R T   M E N U              *
058800********************************************************
058900 300-REPORT-MENU.
059000     MOVE "QUOTEMEN2" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
035800
035900     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
036000        GO TO 399-EXIT.
036100
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036600        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 300-REPORT-MENU.
062400*******************************************
062500*   POSSIBLE SELECTIONS FROM REPORT MENU: *
062600*  QR1-QUOTE REPORT FOR BLANKET ORDERS    *
062700*  QR2-PRINT VENDOR LISTING               *
062800*  QR3-OPEN/CLOSED/REQUIREMENT BY VENDOR  *
062900*  QR4-QUOTE EXPIRATION REPORT            *
063000*  QR5-REQUIREMENT EXPIRATION REPORT      *
063100*  QR6-QUOTES WITHOUT EXPIRATION DATE     *
063200*  QR7-QUOTES WITHOUT QUOTE NUMBER        *
063300*  QR8-QUOTES PAST DUE FROM VENDOR        *
063400*  QR9-COMPARE QUOTE BIDS                 *
063500*******************************************
063600     MOVE 0 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
063700     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR1 "
063800        MOVE 44 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
063900     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR2"
064000        MOVE 71 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
064100     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR3"
064200        MOVE 6 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
064300     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR4"
064400        MOVE 75 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
064500     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR5"
064600        MOVE 76 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
064700     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR6"
064800        MOVE 77 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
064900     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR7"
065000        MOVE 78 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
065100     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR8"
065200        MOVE 74 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
065300     IF SCREEN-KEY = "QR9"
065400        MOVE 81 TO PASS-RPT-NUMBER.
065500
066100     IF PASS-RPT-NUMBER = 0
066200        GO TO 300-REPORT-MENU.
066400
066500      MOVE "ZRSCREEN"           TO   VIEW-CFNAME.
067100          CALL "SRSCRNS" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA,
067200                LANGUAGE-PARMS, PASS-RPT-NUMBER
067600          MOVE "ZUDCQUOT"       TO   VIEW-CFNAME
067700          GO TO 300-REPORT-MENU.
067800
067900 399-EXIT.  EXIT.
072200
124200 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.
125600 949-EXIT.     EXIT.
075600************************************************************
075700*                    B L O W U P                           *
075800*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
075900*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
076000*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
076100*                                                          *
076200*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
076300*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
076400*                                                          *
076500*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
076600************************************************************
076700 990-BLOWUP.
076800     MOVE "TUDCQUOT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
076900     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
077000     CALL  "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
077100           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
077200           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
077300 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
077400
077500 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
079100 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
079200     EXIT.
